# Release & Distribution

## Key Files
- **`.release/DISTRIBUTION.md`** — Signing identity, notarization, and full release process (archive → export → notarize → staple → zip).
- **`.release/TODO.md`** — Development punchlist, tech debt, and feature roadmap. Update after every significant change.

## Release Process
1. Bump version in Xcode project settings.
2. Follow the "Quick Release" section in `.release/DISTRIBUTION.md`.
3. Test the exported `.app` on a clean machine or separate user account.
4. Upload `export/ChoirArranger.zip` to GitHub Releases.

## Rules
- `.release/` is gitignored (contains private signing info). Never commit it.
- Always update `.release/TODO.md` when completing features or adding tech debt.
